{"builtAt":"2026-11-21T09:26:25.801Z","picks":[{"integration":"stripe","entries":[{"id":"cc-playwright-pro","name":"playwright-pro","description":"Playwright Pro turns your AI coding agent into a senior test automation engineer.\n\nInstead of generating tutorial-quality tests with brittle CSS selectors, Playwright Pro enforces battle-tested patterns from production test suites: role-based locators, web-first assertions, proper fixture architecture, and isolated test design.\n\nIt doesn't reinvent Claude Code — it orchestrates it. /pw:generate uses the built-in Explore subagent for codebase analysis. /pw:migrate delegates to /batch for parallel file conversion. /pw:fix leverages /debug for trace inspection. Every skill builds on what Claude Code already does well.\n\n55 ready-to-use test templates across 11 categories — authentication, CRUD, checkout, search, forms, dashboard, settings, onboarding, notifications, API testing, and accessibility. Each template includes TypeScript and JavaScript variants with parametrizable placeholders. Not generic stubs — real patterns like Stripe iframe handling, GraphQL mutation testing, and RBAC permission flows.\n\n3 specialized agents handle complex planning before a single test is written: test-architect maps your application surface, test-debugger diagnoses flaky failures systematically, and migration-planner creates ordered conversion plans from Cypress or Selenium.\n\n2 MCP integrations (TypeScript) connect to TestRail (8 tools) and BrowserStack (7 tools) for teams that need test management and cross-browser coverage. Both are optional — the plugin works fully without them.\n\nSmart hooks auto-validate every test file you write (catches waitForTimeout, hardcoded URLs, non-web-first assertions) and auto-detect Playwright projects on session start. Zero overhead — they run silently.","type":"plugin","platforms":["claude-code"],"origin":"Anthropic community marketplace","vendorCategory":null,"author":null,"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","subpath":"engineering-team/playwright-pro","pin":{"kind":"commit","value":"4a3c05b69e64f4925f7fc65c88890f614f79caf0"},"install":{"claude-code":["/plugin marketplace add anthropics/claude-plugins-community","/plugin install playwright-pro@claude-community"]},"github":{"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","stars":30212,"forks":4186,"pushedAt":"2026-11-21T08:02:58Z","archived":false,"license":"MIT","owner":"alirezarezvani","ownerCreatedAt":"2013-10-16T06:52:39Z","language":"Python"},"integrations":["playwright","stripe"],"jobs":["code-quality","design","browser-automation","project-management","communication","commerce","ai"],"score":{"total":100,"parts":{"popularity":35,"usage":15,"maintenance":25,"license":15,"owner":10}},"scan":{"status":"not-scanned"}},{"id":"cc-stripe-official","name":"stripe","description":"Stripe development plugin for Claude","type":"plugin","platforms":["claude-code"],"origin":"Anthropic official marketplace","vendorCategory":"development","author":null,"repo":"stripe/ai","subpath":"providers/claude/plugin","pin":{"kind":"commit","value":"deae744bc0cbf6034b4b6f22f51c690b71a4e779"},"install":{"claude-code":["/plugin marketplace add anthropics/claude-plugins-official","/plugin install stripe@claude-plugins-official"]},"github":{"repo":"stripe/ai","stars":2076,"forks":385,"pushedAt":"2026-11-21T01:50:03Z","archived":false,"license":"MIT","owner":"stripe","ownerCreatedAt":"2011-06-17T15:42:37Z","language":"TypeScript"},"integrations":["stripe"],"jobs":["commerce","ai"],"score":{"total":87,"parts":{"popularity":26,"usage":11,"maintenance":25,"license":15,"owner":10}},"scan":{"status":"not-scanned"}},{"id":"cc-stripe","name":"stripe","description":"Stripe development plugin for Claude","type":"plugin","platforms":["claude-code"],"origin":"Anthropic community marketplace","vendorCategory":"development","author":null,"repo":"stripe/ai","subpath":"providers/claude/plugin","pin":{"kind":"commit","value":"89ffbee06b3782ed15d77ffd6cbc5620